// A WEAK SUPPLY NEXT TO A STRONG ONE: AS MODELLED IT TAKES WATER IN.
// EXPECT: 3 REJECTED
UNITS LENGTH M
UNITS ELEVATION M
UNITS SIZE MM
UNITS PRESSURE KPA
UNITS FLOW LPM
UNITS KFACTOR LPM/KPA
METHOD HW
USE BORE 120
WATER WA 0 1000
WATER WB 0 520
NODE J1 0
NODE J2 0
SPRINKLER S1 0 -100 80
PIPE A1 WA J1 40 65
PIPE B1 WB J2 5 100
PIPE J12 J1 J2 5 100
PIPE R1 J2 S1 5 50
